{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":44,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"de943d72-dcfc-449d-905c-45b4224c3e74","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511202971,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"（27届校招）流程与数字化管培生","OrgId":3376890,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、参与公司重点业务部门轮岗，快速了解业务流程、组织运作及关键管理场景；\n2、承接专项课题、流程优化、经营分析、项目推进等任务，提升综合解决问题能力；\n3、深入一线业务场景，发现问题、分析问题并推动改善落地；\n4、在导师及部门负责人的辅导下，逐步承担业务模块管理、项目管理或团队协同职责；\n5、根据培养结果及个人能力匹配，后续定岗至相关业务或职能部门，作为管理后备人才重点培养。","Require":"1、硕士学历，土木类、建筑类、生物科学类、环境科学与工程类、材料类、工商管理类、法学类、物流管理与工程类、经济学类、历史学类、管理学类、哲学类等相关专业；\n2、学习能力强，能快速理解新业务、新流程和复杂问题；\n3、逻辑清晰，具备良好的分析判断和问题解决能力；\n4、沟通协调能力较好，具备一定组织推动能力和团队意识；\n5、对商业运营、经营管理、组织管理有兴趣，具备成长为管理者的潜力； \n6、有学生干部、社团负责人、竞赛、创业实践、项目管理经验者优先；\n7、具备较强的抗压能力、目标感和自驱力，愿意接受轮岗及一线历练。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-01T16:50:38.7308223","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"f4b30733-6b81-491a-9333-e65e597b013e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511203940,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"（27届校招）碁耀管培生","OrgId":3376873,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位定位：\n管培生是公司重点储备的未来核心人才，面向优秀应届毕业生，围绕半导体装备主业，通过体系化轮岗、导师带教、实战项目历练，快速培养兼具业务视野与专业能力的技术 / 管理后备力量，深度参与国产半导体装备自主突破事业。\n培养方向：\n-技术研发方向：光学、机械、电气、软件算法，深耕设备核心技术开发与迭代\n- 生产制造方向：工艺、制程、设备调试、供应链，打通装备生产落地全链路\n- 营销销服方向：市场、销售、技术支持，对接客户需求，负责设备交付与技术服务\n- 职能管理方向：人力、运营、质量，支撑公司业务高效运转","Require":"我们希望你：\n1. 2027 届优秀本硕博毕业生，国内顶级高校或QS100海外院校，专业不限；\n2. 专业基础扎实，求知欲强，愿意扎根半导体装备行业；\n3. 认同国产替代使命，抗压能力强，具备良好沟通协作、学习复盘能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-01T11:11:33","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"40394580-8295-4cc9-8872-fa4aebacc9e8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511203328,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"（27届校招）AI应用工程师","OrgId":3376890,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.参与AI相关项目的需求分析、方案设计、开发测试及落地应用； \n协助推进大模型、智能问答、知识库、数据分析、自动化办公等AI场景建设； \n2.参与业务数据整理、模型调用、提示词优化、效果评估及持续迭代；\n3.支持各部门AI工具使用、流程优化和智能化应用探索；\n4.跟踪AI技术发展趋势，结合公司业务提出可落地的应用建议。","Require":"1.计算机、软件、自动化等专业、硕士及以上学历； \n2.了解机器学习、深度学习、大模型、自然语言处理、数据分析等基础知识； \n3.对AI应用落地有兴趣，具备较强学习能力和动手实践能力；\n4.逻辑思维清晰，能够结合业务场景分析问题并提出解决方案； \n5.有AI项目、算法竞赛、数据分析、智能体、大模型应用、知识库搭建经验者优先；\n6.具备良好的沟通能力，能与业务部门协作推进AI场景落地。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-31T14:42:09","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"ee94c715-79e2-46d0-ba6f-c33f0e8c9840","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511203269,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"（27届校招）售后销售工程师","OrgId":3376885,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、技术评审流程审核\n参与重点客户项目前期技术评审、识别技术方案、现场条件、验收标准中的风险、提醒销售、产品、研发、售后提前处理问题\n2、排产风险项目识别\n设备排产阶段对风险项目进行识别和剔除，在设备排产阶段，组织排产会议（售前、售后、产品线、品质部、CIP、产品经理等参加），拉通设备需求明细、验收风险点分析等。减少返修率，提升客户满意度和FAT验收一次通过率等\n3、FAT验收推动\n针对客户现场FAT和合同验收中暴露的问题进行协调、推动研发、产品、售后、质量等部门解决验收卡点\n4、批量性设备交付跟进\n负责设备订单交付的全流程，包括订单评审、排产跟进、交期管控、前置对接（客户需求）、交付统筹协调、现场设备安装调试、试产、问题归纳汇总等全流程工作。","Require":"1.本科及以上，机械、机电、自动化、光电、电子、电气等相关专业。\n2.熟悉设备交付流程，具备技术评审与风险识别能力，能前置排查方案、现场及验收风险，协同部门提前解决。\n3.具备排产风险识别与跨部门协调能力，能组织排产会议，对齐需求与验收标准，提升交付质量及FAT一次通过率。\n4.熟悉FAT及合同验收流程，能统筹各部门推动验收问题闭环。\n5.负责批量设备订单全流程交付（订单评审、交期管控、现场调试跟进、复盘总结）。\n6.逻辑清晰，沟通协调与统筹推进能力强，具备风险预判、执行力与结果闭环意识。\n7.熟练使用办公软件，能独立制作台账与进度报表，可并行推进多项目，责任心强，抗压能力良好。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-31T11:41:00","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"b3238df5-3fd0-4aa4-b972-508802c9c9d4","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511203267,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"（27届校招）售后技术支持储备干部","OrgId":3376885,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.参与售后全流程轮岗，负责设备出厂安装调试、现场交付、客户操作及维护培训，保障项目顺利交付。\n2.负责客户端设备问题排查、故障分析与落地解决，做好设备日常维保及预防性维护，保障设备稳定运行。\n3.整理售后故障数据与案例，完成数据复盘、简报输出，提出优化改善建议并跟进落地。\n4.轮岗期间同步学习团队协作、客户统筹、流程优化等管理工作，后期承接团队辅助管理事务，优秀者定向培养为售后管理骨干。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，电子、机电、机械、物理、工业工程、土木类、建筑、生物科学类、环境科学与工程类、材料类、化学类等理工科专业；\n2.具备良好的数据分析、文字总结及汇报简报能力，逻辑清晰，问题分析能力强；\n3.沟通协调能力良好，能高效对接客户与内部团队，高效处理现场问题；\n4、综合素质过硬：拥有较强自驱力与主动学习能力，积极沉淀技术与业务经验；抗压能力强，能适应中长期出差及阶段性工作节奏；\n5、心态踏实、责任心强，有团队意识与管理意愿，愿意从基层沉淀，长期往管理方向发展。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-31T11:39:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"74b991e9-8d17-4d57-9da9-2db8cc03284b","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511203266,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"（27届校招）售后技术支持工程师","OrgId":3376885,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.按照公司流程及标准, 对出货设备进行安装调试和客户培训等交付工作;\n2.负责客户端问题的分析和解決; 保证设备的持续稳定运行;\n3. 定期对设备进行维护保养, 设备的预防性处理工作;\n4.对客户端设备问题进行整理、 分析,提出改善意见并跟进。","Require":"1.本科学历，电子/机电/自动化或相关专业；\n2. 良好的数据分析及简报能力；\n3.具有较强的逻辑思维能力、分析能力和沟通能力；\n4. 能够适应中长期出差。","ClassificationOne":nul